{%- comment -%}
  Essence Chat widget loader.

  Fast-prototype path:
    1. Upload widget/essence-chat.js to your theme's assets (Online Store →
       Themes → ⋯ → Edit code → Assets → Add a new asset), OR host it on your
       backend / a CDN and point `src` at that URL.
    2. Save this file as snippets/essence-chat.liquid.
    3. Add  {% render 'essence-chat' %}  near the end of layout/theme.liquid,
       just before </body>.

  The data-endpoint must match the App Proxy subpath you configure in the
  Shopify Partner dashboard (default below: /apps/essence-chat).
{%- endcomment -%}
<script
  src="{{ 'essence-chat.js' | asset_url }}"
  data-endpoint="/apps/essence-chat"
  data-greeting="Tell me how you're feeling, and I'll help you find the right essence."
  defer></script>
